# Clip: quickstart. Needs a clean stack boot (minutes). Run only via record-quickstart.sh, which holds the docker lock.
Hide
Type "bash --noprofile --norc" Enter
Type "export PS1='$ ' && cd @REPO@" Enter
Type "export NO_COLOR=1" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "docker compose up -d --wait 2>&1 | grep --line-buffered -v -E '^(time=|WARN)' | cut -c1-104" Sleep 600ms Enter
Wait+Screen@360s /Healthy/
Sleep 1s
Type "docker compose ps --format 'table {{.Service}}\t{{.Status}}'" Sleep 600ms Enter
Wait+Screen@30s /Up .*healthy/
Sleep 5s
